# Alias for API settings documentation. The actual runtime file is backend/.env.
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env instead of populating this file.
# Required keys: DATABASE_URL, FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH or
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON, GROQ_API_KEY (optional), CORS_ORIGINS.
# Never place real API keys in Git, browser environment files or README examples.
